OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehog's overnight antics caught
OL,4,Aon shop CCTV
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gift shop owner was given a fright
OL,7,Fafter a prickly intruder caused
OL,8,Fmischief overnight.
OL,10,FRachel Eaton, from Curiosity Swanage,
OL,11,Fsaid she thought something "a little
OL,12,Fbit freaky" was going on when items
OL,13,Fmysteriously started moving and
OL,14,Fbreaking in the shop's outside yard at
OL,15,Fthe start of the week.
OL,17,FBut after checking the shop's CCTV, the
OL,18,Fteam spotted a hedgehog dangling from a
OL,19,Fhanging basket and the mystery was
OL,20,Fsolved.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
