OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehog's overnight antics caught
OL,4,Aon shop CCTV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe young animal was safely collected
OL,7,Fby the team on Wednesday and passed on
OL,8,Fto Dorset Hedgehog Rescue.
